From e4a070cb4dac35785ba5edbff5984fa11510eb89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chain01 <15863338830@163.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 11:40:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] boards: add SiFli SF32LB52 ULP support

Add a PBLBOOT board for the SiFli SF32LB52-LCHSPI-ULP with 16 MiB flash, Back+Select recovery combo, and optional watchdog handoff. The ULP image uses the PebbleOS 64 KiB boot, dual 3 MiB firmware, and 512 KiB PRF partition layout.
